{
  "_readme": [
    "Explicit Qikink SKUs. Anything here beats the codes derived in server/skus.js.",
    "",
    "`caseModels` is keyed by '<case style>/<phone model>' — phone cases have one",
    "SKU per model, so there is nothing to derive. Fill these in from your Qikink",
    "product list (Dashboard -> Products, or `npm run verify:skus`).",
    "",
    "`variants` is keyed by '<slug>/<colourway>/<size>' and overrides a single",
    "variant. Use it when a specific colourway ships on a different blank.",
    "A value may be a plain SKU string or an object:",
    "  { \"sku\": \"...\", \"print_type_id\": 1, \"placement_sku\": \"fr\" }"
  ],

